      "problem": "Let $u=[\\begin{aligned}1 \\\\ -2 \\\\ 1\\end{aligned}]$ and $v=[\\begin{aligned}2 \\\\ 1 \\\\ 0\\end{aligned}].$ Find the vector projection of $u$ onto $v.$\n\n${\\text{proj}}_{v}\\,u=⟨$\n{{field-1}}$,$\n{{field-2}}$,$\n{{field-3}}\n$⟩$",
